{"id":"n63680-1-10","stage":5,"title":"성사 · 办成","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63680-1-10-1","ko":"일이 거의 다 되었는데 망쳐서 속상하겠어.","zh":"事情都快办成了却搞砸了，一定很难受吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"2","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거의","meaning":"几乎，快要","explanation":"거의：几乎，快要","readings":[{"term":"거의","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60090","senseId":"2","lemma":"거의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"快，就要","explanation":"다：快，就要","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"2","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되었는데","meaning":"形成，完成","explanation":"되다：形成，完成；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"12","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"망쳐서","meaning":"搞砸，毁灭","explanation":"망치다：搞砸，毁灭；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"망치다","audio":"/audio/828d7effc3bc90f96ba0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15941","senseId":"1","lemma":"망치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"속상하겠어.","meaning":"伤心，难过","explanation":"속상하다：伤心，难过；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"속상하다","audio":"/audio/a1d7a98c9fd33d129248.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15595","senseId":"1","lemma":"속상하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带着某种计划和意图想要实现的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"1b1da423b101b551","term":"거의","zh":"几乎，快要","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3","entryId":"60090","definition":"离某个状态或限度很近。","pronunciation":["거의","거이"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"快，就要","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"动作或状态的程度似乎接近限定程度地。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"形成，完成","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事物或现象产生或被制造。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"828d7effc3bc90f9","term":"망치다","zh":"搞砸，毁灭","audio":"/audio/828d7effc3bc90f96ba0.mp3","entryId":"15941","definition":"使之灭亡或把其完全弄坏。","pronunciation":["망치다"]},{"id":"a1d7a98c9fd33d12","term":"속상하다","zh":"伤心，难过","audio":"/audio/a1d7a98c9fd33d129248.mp3","entryId":"15595","definition":"因为事与愿违，心里不舒服、很痛苦。","pronunciation":["속ː쌍하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b28c3d92fbde2a7c9c9d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63680-1-10-2","ko":"그러니까 말이야. 성사 직전에 그렇게 됐어.","zh":"就是啊，眼看就成功了，却变成那样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러니까","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그러니까：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그러니까","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58609","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러니까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말이야.","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"성사","meaning":"办成，促成","explanation":"성사：办成，促成","readings":[{"term":"성사","audio":"/audio/76b825ea81580230070b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63680","senseId":"1","lemma":"성사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"직전에","meaning":"之前","explanation":"직전：之前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"직전","audio":"/audio/e2d20dab23d3320df04d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28958","senseId":"1","lemma":"직전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"됐어.","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"12","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f064d1058a27cd38","term":"그러니까","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3","entryId":"58609","definition":"因为那个原因；或因为那样的缘故。","pronunciation":["그러니까"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"76b825ea81580230","term":"성사","zh":"办成，促成","audio":"/audio/76b825ea81580230070b.mp3","entryId":"63680","definition":"寄望的事情如愿实现；或指把事情做成。","pronunciation":["성사"]},{"id":"e2d20dab23d3320d","term":"직전","zh":"之前","audio":"/audio/e2d20dab23d3320df04d.mp3","entryId":"28958","definition":"就在某事发生前。","pronunciation":["직쩐"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1f3423fc126a4dcf554c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.584,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63680","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":174,"sequenceScore":3.4107,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["就是啊，眼看就成功了，却变成那样。","外面太冷了，我的手都冻僵了。","事情都快办成了却搞砸了，一定很难受吧。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["就是啊，眼看就成功了，却变成那样。","事情都快办成了却搞砸了，一定很难受吧。","外面太冷了，我的手都冻僵了。"],"answer":0}]}
